  "reasoning": "The facts describe three distinct criminal conduct by the public official Huang: (1) accepting cash, gifts and other benefits in exchange for using his official position – this is the crime of bribery (受贿). (2) Unauthorised use of public funds from the state‑owned enterprise for private lending – this is embezzlement of public funds (挪用公款). (3) A large amount of personal wealth cannot be accounted for by lawful income, indicating the offense of illegal possession with unexplained huge assets (非法占有、巨额财产来源不明). Hence the applicable charges are the three crimes listed.",
